  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Your report, in the file you need.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Every Record can be downloaded as a PDF, a Word document, an Excel workbook or a CSV file. You choose, and you can do it yourself whenever you like.</p>
  <p class="site-words">The Word and PDF versions follow your own report layout, with the photos in the right boxes. Send Quickler a finished report once and every new one comes back looking like it.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Excel and CSV hold the same answers as rows, for when the answers need to go into a spreadsheet or another system.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Need more than one? A whole Check, or one person&#x27;s Records, comes as a zip, with every Record in its own folder.</p>
